      "name": "MainInput",
      "content": "\r\n  uniform sampler2D baseMap : register(s0),\r\n  uniform sampler2D bloomMap : register(s1),\r\n  uniform sampler2D starMap : register(s2),\r\n  uniform sampler2D adaptedLumMap : register(s3),\r\n  uniform float4 Params"
